menu "ReefDO"

    config REEFDO_CLOUD
        bool "Phone app through ESP RainMaker Neo"
        default y
        help
            The board reports to the ESP RainMaker Home app and accepts its acknowledge and alert suspend.
            An observer like the web page: the ladder never depends on it, and nothing changes while the cloud
            is down. Off: no cloud code in the image at all.

    config REEFDO_QEMU
        bool "Build for Espressif's QEMU (open_eth instead of Wi-Fi, simulated tank)"
        default n
        help
            For a smoke test of the real firmware on a PC: the network is QEMU's emulated Ethernet (user-mode,
            port-forwarded to the host), the probe is the virtual tank, and the LED strip is not started.
            Never for a board.

endmenu
